  ┃ Directory URL
  ┃ > https://ca.example.org/acme/directory

    DNS provider
    > its name, such as cloudflare or rfc2136

    DNS credentials file
    > NAME=value lines of the provider's variables

    Server CA file
    > PEM, where the server's certificate is not publicly trusted

    Account key ID
    > where the server asks for account binding

    HMAC key file
    > the key the server gave with the key ID
